## OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

## Local secrets and machine-specific config
# Mews keeps its own settings under %APPDATA%\Mews, but keep this here so a future
# plugin that wants a local .env does not leak one by accident.
.env
*.local.json

## Kept local, not published
# Working notes rather than part of the shipped project.
IDEAS.md
CHANGELOG.md
